riptLanguage::CodeCompletionOption; A = DefaultAllocator]' at ./core/templates/list.h:138:28,\r\n>     inlined from 'List<T, A>::Element* List<T, A>::push_back(const T&) [with T = ScriptLanguage::CodeCompletionOption; A = DefaultAllocator]' at ./core/templates/list.h:297:16,\r\n>     inlined from 'void CodeEdit::add_code_completion_option(CodeCompletionKind, const String&, const String&, const Color&, const Ref<Resource>&, const Variant&, int)' at scene\\gui\\code_edit.cpp:2238:44:\r\n> ./core/os/memory.h:221:23: error: using a dangling pointer to 'C.1282' [-Werror=dangling-pointer=]\r\n>   221 |                 memcpy((uint8_t *)p_dst, (uint8_t *)p_src, p_num * sizeof(T));\r\n>       |                 ~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n> ./core/object/script_language.h: In member function 'void CodeEdit::add_code_completion_option(CodeCompletionKind, const String&, const String&, const Color&, const Ref<Resource>&, const Variant&, int)':\r\n> ./core/object/script_language.h:322:40: note: 'C.1282' declared here\r\n>   322 |                 CodeCompletionOption() {}\r\n>       |                                        ^\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nI'm 90% sure this is a [false positive](https://gcc.gnu.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=109514). GCC really doesn't seem to understand this code. I've added an ignore with the others at the top of the file.\r\n\r\nEdit: Sorry about repeated pushes, gcc is being difficult about this :|","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952743750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324670364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105928#issuecomment-3324670364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105928","id":3324670364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GKnGc","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T16:08:25Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T16:12:27Z","body":"Of course I had to test a similar situation to #110709, this time with `Array` constructors in the GDScript VM.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary><strong>Script</strong></summary>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tbenchmark_untyped()\r\n\tbenchmark_typed()\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_untyped() -> void:\r\n\tvar time_start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in pow(2, 21):\r\n\t\tvar x := [\r\n\t\t\t1,\r\n\t\t\t2,\r\n\t\t\t4,\r\n\t\t\t8,\r\n\t\t\t16,\r\n\t\t\t32,\r\n\t\t\t64,\r\n\t\t\t128,\r\n\t\t\t256,\r\n\t\t\t512,\r\n\t\t\t1024,\r\n\t\t\t2048,\r\n\t\t\t4096,\r\n\t\t\t8192,\r\n\t\t\t16384,\r\n\t\t\t32768,\r\n\t\t\t65536,\r\n\t\t\t131072,\r\n\t\t\t262144,\r\n\t\t\t524288,\r\n\t\t\t1048576,\r\n\t\t\t2097152,\r\n\t\t\t4194304,\r\n\t\t\t8388608,\r\n\t\t\t16777216,\r\n\t\t\t33554432,\r\n\t\t\t67108864,\r\n\t\t\t134217728,\r\n\t\t\t268435456,\r\n\t\t\t536870912,\r\n\t\t\t1073741824,\r\n\t\t\t2147483648,\r\n\t\t\t4294967296,\r\n\t\t\t8589934592,\r\n\t\t\t17179869184,\r\n\t\t\t34359738368,\r\n\t\t\t68719476736,\r\n\t\t\t137438953472,\r\n\t\t\t274877906944,\r\n\t\t\t549755813888,\r\n\t\t\t1099511627776,\r\n\t\t\t2199023255552,\r\n\t\t\t4398046511104,\r\n\t\t\t8796093022208,\r\n\t\t\t17592186044416,\r\n\t\t\t35184372088832,\r\n\t\t\t70368744177664,\r\n\t\t\t140737488355328,\r\n\t\t\t281474976710656,\r\n\t\t\t562949953421312,\r\n\t\t\t1125899906842624,\r\n\t\t\t2251799813685248,\r\n\t\t\t4503599627370496,\r\n\t\t\t9007199254740992,\r\n\t\t\t18014398509481984,\r\n\t\t\t36028797018963968,\r\n\t\t\t72057594037927936,\r\n\t\t\t144115188075855872,\r\n\t\t\t288230376151711744,\r\n\t\t\t576460752303423488,\r\n\t\t\t1152921504606846976,\r\n\t\t\t2305843009213693952,\r\n\t\t\t4611686018427387904,\r\n\t\t]\r\n\tvar time_end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"time untyped: %dms\" % ((time_end - time_start) / 1000))\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_typed() -> void:\r\n\tvar time_start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in pow(2, 21):\r\n\t\tvar x: Array[int] = [\r\n\t\t\t1,\r\n\t\t\t2,\r\n\t\t\t4,\r\n\t\t\t8,\r\n\t\t\t16,\r\n\t\t\t32,\r\n\t\t\t64,\r\n\t\t\t128,\r\n\t\t\t256,\r\n\t\t\t512,\r\n\t\t\t1024,\r\n\t\t\t2048,\r\n\t\t\t4096,\r\n\t\t\t8192,\r\n\t\t\t16384,\r\n\t\t\t32768,\r\n\t\t\t65536,\r\n\t\t\t131072,\r\n\t\t\t262144,\r\n\t\t\t524288,\r\n\t\t\t1048576,\r\n\t\t\t2097152,\r\n\t\t\t4194304,\r\n\t\t\t8388608,\r\n\t\t\t16777216,\r\n\t\t\t33554432,\r\n\t\t\t67108864,\r\n\t\t\t134217728,\r\n\t\t\t268435456,\r\n\t\t\t536870912,\r\n\t\t\t1073741824,\r\n\t\t\t2147483648,\r\n\t\t\t4294967296,\r\n\t\t\t8589934592,\r\n\t\t\t17179869184,\r\n\t\t\t34359738368,\r\n\t\t\t68719476736,\r\n\t\t\t137438953472,\r\n\t\t\t274877906944,\r\n\t\t\t549755813888,\r\n\t\t\t1099511627776,\r\n\t\t\t2199023255552,\r\n\t\t\t4398046511104,\r\n\t\t\t8796093022208,\r\n\t\t\t17592186044416,\r\n\t\t\t35184372088832,\r\n\t\t\t70368744177664,\r\n\t\t\t140737488355328,\r\n\t\t\t281474976710656,\r\n\t\t\t562949953421312,\r\n\t\t\t1125899906842624,\r\n\t\t\t2251799813685248,\r\n\t\t\t4503599627370496,\r\n\t\t\t9007199254740992,\r\n\t\t\t18014398509481984,\r\n\t\t\t36028797018963968,\r\n\t\t\t72057594037927936,\r\n\t\t\t144115188075855872,\r\n\t\t\t288230376151711744,\r\n\t\t\t576460752303423488,\r\n\t\t\t1152921504606846976,\r\n\t\t\t2305843009213693952,\r\n\t\t\t4611686018427387904,\r\n\t\t]\r\n\tvar time_end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"time typed: %dms\" % ((time_end - time_start) / 1000))\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```\r\ntime untyped: 1202ms\r\ntime typed: 1976ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter (GDScript VM unchanged, `resize` + assign):\r\n```\r\ntime untyped: 951ms\r\ntime typed: 1706ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter (GDScript VM `reserve` + `push_back`):\r\n```\r\ntime untyped: 1622ms\r\ntime typed: 2243ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nUnless there is a correct way to do things I'm unaware of, the last result is a bit worrying.\r\n\r\nI should also mention, while making the production builds I noticed a 264KB increase in binary size.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324670364/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3335741948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105928#issuecomment-3335741948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105928","id":3335741948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G02H8","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/follo